14. End-to-end flow recap
Step	URL	What Happens
1️⃣	/	You click “Login with Google”
2️⃣	/auth/google	Redirects to Google login
3️⃣	/auth/google/callback	Google sends you back → app gets your info
4️⃣	/enable-2fa	(First time) generates QR code for Authenticator
5️⃣	/verify-2fa	You type the 6-digit code → app verifies and enables 2FA
6️⃣	/2fa	(Next logins) asks for 2FA code before granting full access
7️⃣	/logout	Clears session and logs out

